<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>open court</i> before the house,
				<i>courtyard,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.433
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.774
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1044.17
			</span></i> (Halic., <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>steading</i> for cattle, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλῆς ὑπεράλμενον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.138
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later,
				<i>court</i> or <i>quadrangle,</i> round which the house was
			built, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				131
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				311a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			generally, <i>court, hall,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζηνὸς αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.74
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				6.247
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Διὸς αὐλήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					122
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐ. νεκύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					260
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <i>court</i> of a temple, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱεροῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1299.28
				</span></i>
			 (Eleusis, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), cf. ib.<i><span class="en">
				1126.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				83(84).3
			</span></i>; <i>any dwelling, abode, chamber,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				946
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; of a cave, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				153
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγρόνομοι αὐλαί</span>
			<i>homes</i> of dwellers in the wild, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				786
			</span></i> (lyr.); later, <i>country-house,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				6.50
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ αὐλή</span>
			<i>the Court,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλὰς θεραπεύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					897
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.
				97
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				145
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.26.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ περὶ τὴν αὐλήν</span> the
				<i>courtiers,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				36.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				735.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Mus.Alex.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; at Rome, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				1.10.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ βασίλειος αὐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					3.11.7
				</span></i>
			. (Wrongly expld. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος
				διαπνεόμενος</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐλός</span>) by <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				5.189b
			</span></i>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
